<title>USA: Strategia Corp starts trading on Amex.</title>
<headline>Strategia Corp starts trading on Amex.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strategia Corp Wednesday started trading on the American Stock Exchange under the symbol &quot;SAA.&quot;</p>
<p>The dataprocessing company of Louisville, Ky., was listed on the over-the-counter bulletin board before.</p>
<p>Strategia's stock opened at 13-1/8 Wednesday, and traded at 13 in the late afternoon, with about 46,000 shares changing hands during the day.</p>
